it('실제 CLI entry의 output/catch는 검토2·정상0·준비오류1이며 시험 전역 exitCode를 건드리지 않는다',()=>{const path='scripts/backfill-order-list-projection-20261027.mts',source=readFileSync(path,'utf8'),ast=ts.createSourceFile(path,source,ts.ScriptTarget.Latest,true,ts.ScriptKind.TS);let output:ts.ArrowFunction|undefined,failed:ts.ArrowFunction|undefined;function visit(node:ts.Node){if(ts.isPropertyAssignment(node)&&node.name.getText(ast)==='output'&&ts.isArrowFunction(node.initializer))output=node.initializer;if(ts.isCallExpression(node)&&ts.isPropertyAccessExpression(node.expression)&&node.expression.name.text==='catch'&&ts.isArrowFunction(node.arguments[0]))failed=node.arguments[0];ts.forEachChild(node,visit);}visit(ast);expect(output).toBeTruthy();expect(failed).toBeTruthy();const fakeProcess={exitCode:0},fakeConsole={log:vi.fn(),error:vi.fn()};const run=(arrow:ts.ArrowFunction)=>{const code=ts.transpileModule('const callback='+arrow.getText(ast),{compilerOptions:{module:ts.ModuleKind.CommonJS,target:ts.ScriptTarget.ES2022}}).outputText;return new Function('console','process',code+';return callback;')(fakeConsole,fakeProcess);};const callback=run(output!);for(const status of ['help','ready-offline','report-confirmed']){fakeProcess.exitCode=0;callback({status});expect(fakeProcess.exitCode).toBe(0);}callback({status:'review-required',rejectedDocuments:1});expect(fakeProcess.exitCode).toBe(2);fakeProcess.exitCode=0;run(failed!)();expect(fakeProcess.exitCode).toBe(1);});
